      "id": "claim_ea28cc4ffc6c4109bbb11bf78aae473e",
      "statement": "Quick setup requires Node.js 22.18 or later (it runs the TypeScript setup file), a Ulabase service (create one at ulabase.com), and Angular CLI. The four steps are: clone and install, point to service (edit environment.dev.ts), run ulabase setup to configure the service, and start with ng serve.",
